{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749000/extras/KissOnCheek_3.gif?t=1749401886\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;This place <strong>scares</strong> me. Just when I think I've settled in, it <strong>changes</strong>. I <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">don't</span></strong> want to go out. It hurts... But I'm <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">happy</span></strong> tired of being here. Maybe I should go out for just a second? Just for a second... I want to see something other than my\u00a0<strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">personality</span></strong> room...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Visual Style</strong> - Combining a <u>dark dystopian atmosphere</u> with a <u>sweet story</u>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u0421olourful Story</strong> - Experience a <u>vivid</u> and <u>emotional story</u> about <u>love</u>, <u>death</u>, <u>androids</u>, and <u>the legacy after death</u>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Date &amp; Fight</strong> - Experience the <u>gameplay mix</u> of <u>dating simulator</u> and <u>bloody action</u> with all the consequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Corporation Tower</strong> - Encounter the <u>living embodiment</u> of the tower of a <u>mysterious corporation</u> that <u>rebuilds locations</u> at will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Personality Attractor</strong> - <u>Meet Rika</u>, this is an <u>android girl</u> who can contain <u>different personalities</u> of other androids, and <u>switch between them</u> on the fly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749000/extras/M.E.C.H.A._-_Change_Person.gif?t=1749401886\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3749000?t=1749401886","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3749000?t=1749401886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749000/82e434a23ef5103869e0568aa14d58512726f2fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749401886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749000/82e434a23ef5103869e0568aa14d58512726f2fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749401886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes of violence, and also has some consumables in the form of alcohol or hallucinogenic mushrooms, which may not be suitable for all persons."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749000/extras/KissOnCheek_3.gif?t=1749401886\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;This place <strong>scares</strong> me. Just when I think I've settled in, it <strong>changes</strong>. I <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">don't</span></strong> want to go out. It hurts... But I'm <strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">happy</span></strong> tired of being here. Maybe I should go out for just a second? Just for a second... I want to see something other than my\u00a0<strong><span class=\"bb_strike\">personality</span></strong> room...&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Visual Style</strong> - Combining a <u>dark dystopian atmosphere</u> with a <u>sweet story</u>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u0421olourful Story</strong